B.O_=new A.dz("Who we are","ShapePrompt is a small creative 3D printing workshop. Write to us: hello@craftaxi.com. This site is a hackathon demo: payments run in PayPal Sandbox and no real money is charged. The seller's full details will be listed here before real sales begin.")
B.NX=new A.dz("Age","You must be 18 or older to pay on this site.")
B.NQ=new A.dz("Prices","All prices are in z\u0142 and include VAT 23%. Delivery, if any, is shown before you pay.")
B.NY=new A.dz("Ready works","Every ready work is printed only after you order it, with your own words on it \u2014 on the front of the base or hidden underneath. That is our workshop's rule. Because it is made to your specification, the 14-day right of withdrawal does not apply (Art. 38 point 3 of the Polish Consumer Rights Act).")
B.NS=new A.dz("Figurines made to your request","They are made to your own specification, so the 14-day right of withdrawal does not apply (Art. 38 point 3 of the Polish Consumer Rights Act). Before printing, our master sends you 2\u20133 pictures of the 3D model. Your approval of these pictures is our agreement: the figurine is printed as approved. We print with plastic filament, not resin: small details come out simpler, thin parts may be glued on, and for now a figurine has one color.")
B.NT=new A.dz("The 15 z\u0142 deposit","A request reaches our master only with the deposit. It pays for looking at your request and making the 3D model, and it counts toward the price. It is returned only if our master declines your request before starting work. If the picture can't be used, our master asks for another one; the deposit waits for this request for 30 days, then the request is closed and the deposit is not returned. A request that breaks the rules below is closed without returning the deposit.")
B.NU=new A.dz("3D files","The download starts right after the payment, so you lose the 14-day right of withdrawal (Art. 38 point 13 of the Polish Consumer Rights Act) \u2014 you agree to this before paying. Personal use only: reselling or sharing the file, and selling prints of it, is not allowed.")
B.NW=new A.dz("What we never make","Weapons and weapon parts, replicas and ammunition; drones of any kind used in war and their parts; bombs, grenades, missiles and explosives; nude or sexual images; blood and cruelty; hate symbols; film, cartoon and game heroes and logos that belong to companies; anything against the law. Our master may decline any request.")
B.NR=new A.dz("Your picture","You confirm that the picture is yours or that you may use it. Photos of the finished figurine, with the ShapePrompt watermark, may appear in the portfolio of our master. You choose whether our master may sell copies of the figurine (10% off your next figurine) or it stays only yours (exclusive, +25\u201350% to the price).")
B.NZ=new A.dz("Complaints","If what you receive doesn't match the approved model, or arrives damaged, write to hello@craftaxi.com with photos. We answer within 14 days. Your legal rights for goods that don't match the agreement stay in force.")
B.O0=new A.dz("Privacy","Your email and picture are kept for 90 days, only to answer your request, and are not given to anyone. Payments are handled by PayPal; we never see your card. To protect the workshop, an address that tried to order forbidden things is kept for 24 hours, and the email and PayPal account of a customer our master blocked are kept for one year (our legitimate interest, GDPR Art. 6(1)(f)). A blocked customer can write to us to explain.")
B.J6=A.a(s([B.O_,B.NX,B.NQ,B.NY,B.NS,B.NT,B.NU,B.NW,B.NR,B.NZ,B.O0]),A.ai("x<+(l,l)>"))
