B.Eu=new A.my("fruit_stand","Three-Tier Fruit Stand","Three plates with scalloped edges on one stem, for fruit, sweets or cupcakes. The flowers on the plates are drawn by hand.","assets/files/stand.jpg",!1,"220 \xd7 220 \xd7 228 mm",10,"Tinkercad: cylinders for the plates and the stem, the flowers drawn freehand with the Sketch tool, all aligned on one axis.","PLA, 0.2 mm layers. Needs a bed of at least 220 \xd7 220 mm, or scale it down in the slicer. Supports under the plates.")
B.Eq=new A.my("coder_box","Box for a Programmer","A box with a lid and a secret: one side says THE ANSWER IS WITHIN, the other carries a message in hex code that only a programmer can read. A gift for someone who writes code.","assets/files/box.jpg",!1,"238 \xd7 190 \xd7 103 mm (box and lid together)",10,"Tinkercad: boxes hollowed out for the box and the lid, the words made of letter shapes.","PLA, 0.2 mm layers. Print the box and the lid side by side, no supports.")
B.Er=new A.my("crystal_vase","Crystal Bowl","Facets outside, a smooth round bowl inside \u2014 like a cut crystal. For keys, jewelry, sweets or a small plant.","assets/files/crystal.jpg",!1,"167 \xd7 168 \xd7 83 mm",5,"Tinkercad: a faceted shape hollowed out by a sphere, on a round foot.","PLA or PETG, 0.2 mm layers. Supports under the outer facets.")
B.Et=new A.my("round_bowl","Round Bowl","A smooth, simple bowl for the table or the shelf.","assets/files/bowl.jpg",!1,"180 \xd7 180 \xd7 84 mm",5,"Tinkercad: a sphere hollowed out by a second sphere.","PLA or PETG, 0.2 mm layers. Prints without supports.")
B.Es=new A.my("grass_holder","Cat Grass Stand","Our master grew herbs in an indoor mini garden \u2014 and cat grass for the cat. This stand is made to the size of one seed pod: take the cat grass out of the garden, put it in the stand and give it to the cat without harming the herbs, then put it back. With a little water inside, the grass can even travel with you.","assets/files/holder.jpg",!0,"100 \xd7 220 \xd7 145 mm",5,"Tinkercad: boxes joined and hollowed out, measured to fit a mini garden seed pod.","Printed in PLA. For water inside, PETG is better. 0.2 mm layers, no supports.")
